From 5cb80b7c34cee6b20179254ee8fc4c650d32cd93 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Mr_Fire_ <vadimzhunda@gmail.com>
Date: Thu, 2 Jul 2026 15:19:32 +0300
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] feat: NeoForge support (generate --neoforge)

Adds a NeoForge resolver that runs the NeoForge installer headless
(--install-client) via Java, extracts the version manifest + loader jars +
libraries, and packages them into the distribution (ForgeHosted parent +
VersionManifest + libraries). Wires a --neoforge CLI flag, ServerMeta.neoforge,
and Server.struct create/distro branches. NeoForge mods reuse the Forge 1.13+
mod structure (forgemods/, Type.ForgeMod). Verified for MC 1.21.1 / NeoForge
21.1.234: schema-valid distribution, all 50 artifacts present.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
